{
 "schema": 2,
 "about": [
  "The map just test-changed reads (tools/cmd/test-changed). It is written by just test-map (tools/cmd/test-map) from the",
  "build trees, the Quest presets, the Go packages and the tests' own text: never by hand. Each tracked file is in exactly",
  "one component, the one of its directory: its tests in files, or in none the reason it has no test of its own.",
  "A file's tests are its own, then those of each scanner whose globs match it; a test that walks the tree (rglob, glob,",
  "iterdir, os.walk or git ls-files over the repository) is a scanner the generator derives from its text (walkers.go).",
  "A test id is a target below, or",
  "gtest:<binary> (just test-auth-unit <binary>), just:<recipe>, go:<package under tools/> (go -C tools test -count=1 ./<package>)",
  "or pytest:<name> (tools/tests/<name>.py). {preset} in a target is the build preset, else mingw-release.",
  "A land runs only the fast unit tests: the heavy ids (internal/testmap heavy.go) are listed and skipped by test-changed,",
  "and run by test-changed -heavy."
 ],
 "targets": {
  "agents-imports": [
   "python3",
   "tools/verify_agents_imports.py"
  ],
  "build": [
   "just",
   "build"
  ],
  "crash-ingest-vet": [
   "go",
   "-C",
   "tests/crash-ingest",
   "vet",
   "./..."
  ],
  "doc-paths": [
   "python3",
   "tools/verify_doc_paths.py"
  ],
  "host-seams": [
   "python3",
   "tools/verify_host_seams.py",
   "build/{preset}"
  ],
  "log-rules": [
   "python3",
   "tools/verify_log_rules.py"
  ],
  "pe-contract": [
   "python3",
   "tools/verify_pe_contract.py",
   "--dll",
   "build/{preset}/bin/BugSplat64.dll",
   "--runtime-dll",
   "build/{preset}/bin/nevr-runtime.dll"
  ]
 },
